  "steps": [
    "Mix the ricotta, Parmesan, a pinch each of salt and pepper, and the nutmeg until smooth. Set aside.",
    "In a large pot over medium-high heat, warm the olive oil and butter, add the garlic, and saute 1 to 2 min.",
    "Add the beef and all the soup spices (Italian seasoning, paprika, red pepper flakes, onion powder, garlic powder, oregano, pepper and salt). Break the meat up with a wooden spoon and cook until browned with no pink left (160°F).",
    "Stir in the marinara, cream and broth and bring to a gentle boil.",
    "Add the broken lasagna sheets and cook 14-16 min, stirring now and then so they do not stick, until fully tender.",
    "Stir in the parsley, basil, Parmesan and mozzarella.",
    "Ladle into bowls and top with dollops of the ricotta."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "The carousel card counts 4 servings at about 610 cal each; the original recipe says 5 to 6.",
    "The noodles keep drinking broth as the soup sits, so add a splash of broth when reheating."
  ],
